Package: omnecor-hmci-server
Version: 2.4.1~beta.1
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 20.0.0), ca-certificates, xdg-utils
Recommends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, python3-venv, git, curl
Maintainer: Omnecor Team <dev@omnecor.local>
Homepage: https://omnecor.ai
Description: Omnecor HMCI — Context-Aware AI Infrastructure Workstation (server)
 Omnecor is a context-aware AI infrastructure designed as a central nervous
 system for digital and physical workflows. It unites software development,
 business automation, media generation, and hardware engineering.
 .
 This package installs the headless Omnecor backend as a systemd service and
 serves the web workstation at http://localhost:3000. It runs fully offline
 (Sovereign mode) on an embedded libSQL/SQLite database — no external database,
 cloud account, or subscription is required. Optional Python AI microservices
 (Whisper STT, TTS, Valet Router, llama.cpp) are shipped and can be enabled
 separately. For the desktop GUI build, install the Electron package instead.
Installed-Size: 43344
